This package implements the platform interface of the FlutterFire
firebase_database plugin (firebase_database_platform_interface, Copyright 2019
the Chromium project authors, BSD 3-Clause license) and the platform interface
of firebase_core (firebase_core_platform_interface, BSD 3-Clause license). It
depends on those packages. lib/src/values.dart ports transformValue from
firebase_database_platform_interface
(lib/src/method_channel/utils/utils.dart, BSD 3-Clause license). The work is
done by firebase_database_dart, an unofficial pure-Dart client of the Firebase
Realtime Database.

